  "steps": [
    "The night before (or 2 hours in advance), make the coffee chia pudding - Ingredients: To a container add 2 tbsp chia seeds (20g), 1 tsp black coffee (i used a cappuccino sachet), 2 heaped tbsp High Protein Greek yogurt (90g), Mix everything well, Cover and refrigerate.",
    "The next morning or when the chia pudding is ready: To a pan on medium heat add 1 tbsp honey (10g), 1 tsp butter, 2 pitted dates, Fry for 2 min and flip, it takes about 5 min to caramelise.",
